# Autopilot Tests

This project currently uses a dedicated native PlatformIO test environment for CSC tests.

## Commands
- `pio test -e native_csc`: run CSC unit tests (correct workflow)
- `pio run -e native_csc`: expected to fail with missing `main` because this env is test-only

## Notes
- Keep Unity test files on public Unity headers only (`#include <unity.h>`).
- Do not include `unity_internals.h` from C++ tests.
